{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1214,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8a4c11334c04e6bd537a5cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寂寞的时候来打鼓吧！\n来吧！唔吼吼！\n唔吼吼吼！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f99dd340ac73600c6c4f049267da85f006f7d62edde30c0858d164e8f41fdba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e815cfae75b54b49f7b880d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟你说……\r\n我有办法浮在空中\r\n大约10厘米高喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4a238972db8dc19695f73998cbc2624b68e80871bfdb4e08366e669d39c70bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a711c689ff9a9a74ade322a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有次我装上鲨鱼鳍\r\n在海中逼近佐敦，\r\n结果惹她大发飙了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "163ebc54adfaf2ded6eca6a5238e19a1befa10a73297e709094b8cecaad7ff51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f43be3a091ec4baa3baa2bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真无聊，麦麦都不陪我玩。\r\n搞什么嘛。\r\n……啊～～～啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66d822816134e3bc5ea19d981b44a5786c2b4913f43c839cb051ac639d82954b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:872e070468c244e33add3212",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样啊……！因为牌是冰做的，\r\n所以会融化而害我无法听牌……！\r\n中山，你竟敢算计我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c73ecdca7c0c106659ef24cb546b8a0a1e35febd20b321dcc3f08983b13561b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b72f63c025c8d5cbb6801b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吗门闸入要定一跑起？\r\n吗了好就不跑起下蹲地原？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa8f37a51bc0636100c6bcbcf3d74f245ba877d4db6491e80a66228a4998132",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b53a9f56b25060713b777d21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿船体操预备起！\r\n来，脚往后高高踢起～\r\n绑上蝴蝶结～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "51645c5a462d49b52e3788d66019bf097e68a2e68b3a656125332dcdfbcfeec2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e8ba676297c856020892127",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……不好了！脚上的海带\r\n快干掉了……！水、水～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17a8a39a859980be4d8cffe1890dec9bb0ac68df4bb615df1bfdfa2027bb87cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:344759859224f59a8372cc33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糟糕！得快点爬上树才行，\r\n不然会来不及羽化的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "581ab79ca173a1df2f5556241ed42773945a192cdf15a37b124ce78acc69cba8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f6ca8932f3b874dd11c287a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多快到\r\n河岸边开始长出团子的季节了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd13a01c4d8cc64ab166cb0ec2e4997e41a9ee49dec334030b4879ba442d8ede",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30892b6c470ea9bb3c31d63a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "告诉你一个秘密……\r\n听说马里亚纳海沟里\r\n沉睡着梦幻竹轮喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc876482d53e9cfa280d30ac37efe508dc9ab69cb436a7bbcdc65e0b1e2f71a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b460a722e0ab6cec628c35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寂寥气氛中充斥着一片艳红，\r\n这季节就像阿船呢……\r\n你刚刚是不是这么想啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6422f8cc488c22dfb3ebaa147a1e4da722c0cdc6eefe2f54421e87f02dd64b50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa9d2b239ad2ea2a1b111c33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷……！为什么要在\r\n这种时期穿上泳装啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6144da19a105b423b6dd847a3a73b46b284f52b6f8b0131957fb34db801f70fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef23db35d4dabc2a835ddae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏日海滩……？\r\n那个啊，整片海滩都\r\n被阿船我劫持了喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cdc6ddc5bccbd4c592756ea8129e9cddbf2060246e20e3641f5bea4140901e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51e5e3b6f84c6f55b5dff292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Wow！So beautiful～！\r\n阿船真适合海星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "995072cda142e7292b19af180981604cdf8959f50519844bd43fa04d9d70683d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:925d799395e26b1425b29ec5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一闭上眼耳边就会浮现。\r\n我演奏电吉他，死党唱民俗乐\r\n让巴黎为之沸腾的青春岁月……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1981e5a0d7200c9d5455baea9366899e2da96b9e1a0e0471d332a0d979055bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a6a2fced769d3896a75f4cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我下定决心了。要是赢得凯旋门赏\r\n……就要用干贝丝在天狼星的额头\r\n写下「塞纳-马恩省河」三个字！",
      "source_fingerprint": "145b80de3a11a89d363e8b2fe0256a14e3461c5889c198a0a8c91eec93ea89e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06431e8d2cbdd51983962b96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给弟妹们的伴手礼……\r\n就决定送由阿船大人亲手写的\r\n「隆尚灵巧」挂轴了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "730bd5cf57abfbf8b78b2c5e5c88bfcc7b57494dadfcb868be0940700a44a55e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38a04bf9ce1bec320a6eea4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向茶座发起守护灵对战，\r\n却因为太过耀眼而犯规输掉了……！\r\n早知道就不要用砂纸打磨了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e37d62ad0803d7cb05412f26e41ac8ad46bd8108a05972c003335fd7a1b4519",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:609f6c97495cbc34144dfbff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不准发呆。\r\n世界巅峰可不简单喔。\r\n甚至算得上辛酸，酸到适合配饭呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df3a8fd8ee28ff323dcee758b0daecd043d860e72d8faf5cdb66219560be357d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6d3888cf2800b36102d0580",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在征求工读生但都没人来应征！\r\n快来打工，帮忙吟诗\r\n录进麦昆的闹钟里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e38f12ce913859a168f6026698cad10663fb7e6aa11c19117fa775097933e4dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:151ef388540add80286b4d8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好！我彻底习惯因时差而犯傻了！\r\n下一步就是学会利用时差吐槽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c8f01e6aa000a436e19c7ed8377e10e9c193474cd24e507b9d5c2d87324d8f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fae95eaefef80305083a559",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种时候就是要默默地\r\n为你披上一条餐桌布。",
      "source_fingerprint": "807b714f1e0a20eedfe0560b3c309a62d4ce0b1ac718ee2f3a5b34064659ea49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c64d3f7a85e606f034d0ec2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬日埋下的种子已发出新芽……\r\n嘿嘿，这条鰆鱼都长得这么大啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8905dccd03114feeac4580b3f96ec192dca33f6deb69411ff001e9e1d2c9ea0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e66b7b9111669daad09dbdbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呵呵，\r\n要不要享用点冰凉的雪酪呢？\r\n很好，到北极点跟我碰头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0d28043bfcde5b9e90a1ed53dd31cad731408bfe3cc579bb8ec991e22167e9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa29c2b2bbd0217e74c98f18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挑食不肯吃苦柿子吗～？\r\n吃过后意外地très bien～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a142c642f777e1d32c085732426691a272a2536f8d94d1c24a398975dbfddd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc548bdc9682647e7ff4f1d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要召集这附近的孩子们\r\n一起来吃流水局考喔！\r\n你也会来吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d4fa739e71d83f33fe9436813e418196da9cd6d167df197af6173b3bff0df9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e067cc195722b13c0b3d0d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～我下定决心了。\r\n这趟可不光只是来创造回忆的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd520eb7e80af1e33ba9f64a28f3008ba6f99916972962553aa7a4cf9824654b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c25c43a5ddec4a340ef9d3b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "背后的蝴蝶结尺寸只有我指定的\r\n百分之一嘛！是你搞的鬼吧！？\r\n干得好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34a49f74635cac98c119ad84ba4b425424c7f8c579576872f159b9a33f7921a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31944d2c0de529f929017fc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要怎么做？\n碰撞练习吗？行啊，交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "054d5c154ebd205441a503f80dd52920452094ba523d6cfa9f3c0f14ff40de0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30393e8f88277cb0dcc8d123",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくぞーっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21dd11028407d88c1082749caee536903523c9d5a121844bd9bf45ee43c2f095",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c9b5467b95c4f84320606e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇～…我已经厌倦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e3f3fb3174451fac819877359366d6bb0f754853ea688e57e4fd89138fcc00f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7290d069e6c9aefd1ee7bf49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――哈！！\n蚂蚁的数量，数着数着\n不知不觉就数晕了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fa13af17d60ca36518317c2bfac69642398f580926d0021410c4bfdcd94f0e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2aede98d3678c7f029b1f4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "翻着白眼跑步的话\n眼睛就会很干啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd9d896aae53d5660bdf3e7f48aad2edc08c56e668a2e66ca245f1e4b4b364d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:572615fb75498e249d5f6b32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我用泰式无影脚培养的脚力，\n踏响舞台吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4e949792c02dff2e6548dbe19103b512474088f637199b33f2567017c3e9838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:767600464413131168b39a11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "琐事就推给你了。\n要是能来一场\n热血比赛就好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e92155f2fc0c99d7728c5aa427cd77234e9bcaef19be5d7399e0e22dafff88bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b3b6c55ef9b41bf13a99db9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一定要\n到达第9行星！\n要上咯，训练员！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ce1506d418d26b47af257a64f2402d3cb3e7b1479b2515c00680aea583a47be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:885e23a65a4420203ccbc3f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能跟上我的斗争心吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e62bdda21cf4f3c6e068447c54e058ffe3b9aab826d7b3e68b7e9cb69b9acbf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92a2a913be8414cfa311c61b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………？\r\n…………！……，……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "604a78c9448b208a4f37d613af9da9ab9c563ee992048f7b04895c37aea1c21b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68e49097e6eac221a004e134",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次试着伸出舌头跑步好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ac1f61d1b263f72c75c2cdc7e8b40c305aa4c34d05343f00a7bacb00afa1ab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6cb6a8c1e6588f33ef92731",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看招！564火箭筒！\r\n轰隆隆隆隆隆隆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18d4ffd8282410108eb32b9996e8c26ff197b3b77bcbf3c451c9c58f405c9645",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faa7932660af1b1df0e94990",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我种在赛场上的牵牛花\r\n差不多也该长出来了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b6449b6ca2fc91d80bbd63eeb07d969b73536cd8ea5ddba08ec2f8d2f3f9128",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bc8ffaec5b342ed2dd824be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听好啰！任何胜负都要\r\n「全力以赴，预备～开始」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0423abc1999a199b4ee354b1afaa306b799caf4c70bb5a7b3cf990c6839bf90f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9406ce9f2832d7093317ec9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "场地状态差？水中？无重力？\r\n这些都影响不到阿船我啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "329a0750e6a5847494b754d331de4ea3555e11bf551944ba5d96dd8191e31cb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f5d2791aa5385de717b4757",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟我来吧，训练员！\r\n让你见识见识\r\n微观世界的仙女棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd370233c947bc6b63ecc25a1c50f07f6426e1ff775cc0c850b664be6536041a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea52f4c395e7c5c6463a877b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时尚关键果然在于自行改造哪。\r\n干脆弄破还是剪开吧！\r\n我是说你的衣服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f67631ef9ed8dfa44a2768b195837f8aa365c4cc097e594c8f6ef38bb7258eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58a872257105375bdb6e2ef7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在森林中来回冲刺50趟应该够吧。\r\n啊，在说你今天该做的训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b838005e630cb28d2985f490752f7c45885e0fb661e5d50e8213f7d690c491f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b895b42147cd0050bb90abc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这场地根本不够看。\r\n稍微认真起来好了，\r\n我去泼点最浓厚的高汤！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bbdd4e7faa1ad1eda4765f8d1dc9a74933b15d4d663d4ae2d0e0dc844aac5f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ba179e129d9ffba12c8079",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮我用飞机云在天上写出法文。\r\n我会边跑步边背法文的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b747fb81440ea3c038627560180c3a05fc335ac6d9a971adf38f9ce67dd00a1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a35588fb8c85e1af7340f3f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天做得到的事情并不保证\r\n明天也能成功。趁现在好好复习\r\n怎么用酒在料理上点火吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6bd2097bea5105051ad49785422004cbc449510e30f44b6ff2584b6f1666035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d14c8a349d1a012910fc13c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "罐装浓汤的玉米粒就是要\r\n撬开罐子确实吃到。就跟梦想一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "123db90852c661e20cf41c508dadb99ac69b7582786cff3c178067936804b2c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4a2612755b6ac9b351f940e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你手上那是张闪亮的金色船票。\r\n持票根可以兑换\r\n免费加一球面！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29222b6e1938d6088de5ef037f40d8439c081b6edfdfab470fae4e811ef20d5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c572495a3cb9ad8343fc0a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你一起度过，真的非常有趣哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea547a8c30b4ae54d8da8e6d5758efa89ceb829777ef7218e65f8adfb7f4877f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b082d4bbbb15b0148b6465cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你已经习惯了…和我在一起的日子了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6f5be0a7a41c34cbbc17d8b4565892be9e2a1fcb256a67f844190893cc29b4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88315d8e40d859878d15bf25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你在说什么啊，不会这样就结束吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae8e76179c2f66d26d93076cb826f87d8a7472aebce56164e0a36796895f209",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0532aabece4411a17ef4f2c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "记得把我的照片贴在泳镜上喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "595ce9529b86f208eab2b8fce65a799dafcbf68429656dfca7a55dd3afb108ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:046bbb4ac2d77c032c652826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "门的尺寸大小完全影响不到我！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0755bc01ecbd4d0cb063453af3265352df07d40d2a2ba097f124f766552116cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9def800d4b9530d0c74b9608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Merci beaucoup！Healthy pork！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e647a8a6e796ebe1ccd79fea4b397f30339684cf86cd7a2e11e760952d2ae7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98a858a2d944e10810e6a3f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哦哦哦哦哦ーー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdc21a91b8937b4c590bcfc48aca53dca13fcc531b884549a42675244a2f43d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec7f3ad6f58696060a331692",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Explosion！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aa36205ff10af507b0092593894365e7edfc670cd308c4d41e019860ca4e7a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57516d3bcbec4647520106d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，你在呼唤我黄金船大人吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8361f0e69e0b00c3d2cae48283bce2cbded2fd617edba17b12189db41233e98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bba7cba90cee1cd8e551410",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我金船大人吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c446f5fc260045342818947949952b82d178fb8589b932e2a5ee3a60a16313f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c11d7a434f1009a6fed02e67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在追上去还来得及！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23d0b4a34f078bc668adeec8c5c712b23bc0d56f3bcaebb67bc230159ca176f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fde44b7f2df09ee2617e7f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咻～～碰碰！阿船烟火！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8cded8ae30f198727ffc1717dd3c255aa110a8506f0b394df9453f26ac87c66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af3672a4b485ada1f872f71b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀呵～～！\r\n灼热阿船诞生啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a04b0fb54e746ad4e708aa86376a3cfd370a8a5af5de82d0f01da89e570eb84f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da16f282702ccf9080609f59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白色云朵、蓝色海洋……\r\n还有金色的我，阿船！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86b16e3fef7b5e6a98a9f8c3406c78215ef57791f80f26b7e04d99887076d9e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46c9f60fe3295d11de24677b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是黄金船！你喜欢夏天吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd826cc5d0d3c3ef26e0d3d24369daa5cc4a58069252d0b73eb95bbf29d2c980",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11b120f195253db70da29042",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oh là là～！看我的隆尚魂～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a0334afb78a443d899c2832db6661c756f9bd32ebe0e4d362da4dea5a1a3de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f8e97cd845a911efcee210",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大西洋看起来就像小水洼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f745dbc61886f8357042e179e0c7b08aeb88cd7223c7ce6298b9cde785a4b027",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d233056c06879edb6aa9dca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "门不是用来钻的！\r\n要从上面飞越过去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e0a58e7f9e135852f4b8ce47efa848af8c1bfd7c0b206c2e483670241c7c4e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:046da248bcf23bd07ffa198f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请・给・我・一份黄金船☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5de429fbca2c13a55ee38b6d8f7ae128ede18364811ea1d811d96ae1da22cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68878563eb18997650498f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae3e5dcae9a53056d19b3106de1996e8c400c410dfd1c96cb651012cfebc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c5f3c3c098a589be2b52e56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经决定再也不放弃了……！\r\n所以、所以我……！\r\n考试也不会放弃的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "572bdbb8da5c8d99548b7e1b5a0faa92605250b096e7fc98c416ec9b78e8ca75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:018b7287ac0e896b798aff2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f06e9d5d4b590fa75db11b1c2431f76a413069b4adaae557632a142ae95ad45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf91d25e674af1ff913e3c95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0bb56c1edd8e8bfd5adffd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后我也会继续把\r\n我的步调变得更帅的。\r\n要好好跟上哦，伙伴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a76be3ace4d96d7c30bfc775791e06184434f401be2a22a53415afa2da5ca0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b26d8895e2c889eb0c6252f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊──那个、找一天啦。\r\n等我买了摩托车后，就去海边散心。\r\n……两个人一起去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "880f7bf21ec7a8e9164fe2b608bacaa1341094671f996a0a929a941d74c5f2b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91063cb860dc49c9bf581fdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢，新年快乐！\r\n今年的我也会油门全开，\r\n让大家追不上我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a983dd45e08fde9baae40a33332528f94a0118d5bfe155d25e752888aa5331e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:210cb48303512fac1ff9538e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔，又拿到巧克力了。\r\n虽然知道这没有什么特别的用意，\r\n但、但还是会觉得很不好意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1469209ebd9210ca313be645a875c8f0340636ec709ae9af41d1010312ae92f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f01dd5acd0ac9de12f9089a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桌上的……你看到了？就、今天不是\r\n嗯，情、情人节嘛……就只是\r\n答谢你平时的照顾啦，不要多想哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a94935217573e10b5c8ae331ffa64847de15803a7458d8b56392992bcafd403a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "10005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
